이제 auth 코드를 중복하지 않기 위해 `extractToken` 헬퍼를 사용해야 합니다. 하지만 현재 `articles.ts`에 존재합니다. `src/middleware/auth.ts`에도 `authenticate` 데코레이터가 있습니다. 미들웨어를 사용하는 것이 좋을 것 같습니다.

Hurl 스펙에서, POST /api/articles/:slug/comments에는 인증이 필요합니다.
또한 DELETE /api/articles/:slug/comments/:id에도 인증이 필요합니다.

Fastify의 프리핸들러를 사용할 수 있습니다:
app.post("/api/articles/:slug/comments", { preHandler: app.authenticate }, async (request, reply) => { ... })

그런데 `authenticate` 미들웨어를 기억하시나요?
auth.ts에서:
export const authenticate = async (request: any, reply: FastifyReply) => {
  const authHeader = request.headers.authorization;
  if (!authHeader) {
    reply.code(401).send({ errors: { token: ["is missing"] } });
    return;
  }
  const match = authHeader.match(/^Token\s+(.+)$/i);
  if (!match) {
    reply.code(401).send({ errors: { token: ["is missing"] } });
    return;
  }
  try {
    const decoded = jwt.verify(match[1], JWT_SECRET) as { id: string; username: string; email: string };
    request.user = decoded;
  } catch {
    reply.code(401).send({ errors: { credentials: ["invalid"] } });
  }
};

좋습니다. 이제 `app.authenticate`를 사용할 수 있습니다.

그러나 요청에러가 발생할 수 있습니다. `reply.code(401).send(...)`을 사용하기 전에 `return`을 빨리 하지 않으면 Fastify가 계속 실행됩니다. 현재 미들웨어는 잘 작동합니다.

좋습니다. 댓글 라우트를 작성하겠습니다.
`src/routes/comments.ts`

```typescript
import type { FastifyInstance, FastifyRequest, FastifyReply } from "fastify";
import prisma from "../lib/prisma.js";

export async function commentsRoutes(app: FastifyInstance): Promise<void> {
  // GET /api/articles/:slug/comments - 댓글 목록 조회
  app.get("/api/articles/:slug/comments", async (request: any, reply: FastifyReply) => {
    const slug = request.params.slug as string;
    const token = request.headers.authorization as string | undefined;
    let currentUserId: string | null = null;

    if (token) {
      try {
        const match = token.match(/^Token\s+(.+)$/i);
        if (match) {
          const jwt = await import("jsonwebtoken");
          const JWT_SECRET = process.env.JWT_SECRET ?? "your-secret-key";
          const decoded = jwt.verify(match[1], JWT_SECRET) as any;
          currentUserId = decoded.id;
        }
      } catch {
        // ignore
      }
    }

    const article = await prisma.article.findUnique({
      where: { slug },
      include: { author: { select: { username: true } } },
    });

    if (!article) {
      return reply.code(404).send({ errors: { article: ["not found"] } });
    }

    const comments = await prisma.comment.findMany({
      where: { articleId: article.id },
      include: {
        author: { select: { username: true } },
      },
      orderBy: { createdAt: "desc" },
    });

    return reply.send({
      comments: comments.map((c) => ({
        id: c.id,
        body: c.body,
        createdAt: c.createdAt,
        updatedAt: c.updatedAt,
        author: {
          username: c.author.username,
        },
      })),
    });
  });

  // POST /api/articles/:slug/comments - 댓글 생성
  app.post("/api/articles/:slug/comments", { preHandler: app.authenticate }, async (request: any, reply: FastifyReply) => {
    const slug = request.params.slug as string;
    const { comment } = request.body as { comment?: { body?: string } };
    const { body } = comment || {};

    // 필드 검증
    if (!body || body.trim() === "") {
      return reply.code(422).send({ errors: { body: ["can't be blank"] } });
    }

    const article = await prisma.article.findUnique({
      where: { slug },
    });

    if (!article) {
      return reply.code(404).send({ errors: { article: ["not found"] } });
    }

    const newComment = await prisma.comment.create({
      data: {
        body: body.trim(),
        articleId: article.id,
        authorId: request.user!.id,
      },
      include: {
        author: { select: { username: true } },
      },
    });

    return reply.code(201).send({
      comment: {
        id: newComment.id,
        body: newComment.body,
        createdAt: newComment.createdAt,
        updatedAt: newComment.updatedAt,
        author: {
          username: newComment.author.username,
        },
      },
    });
  });

  // DELETE /api/articles/:slug/comments/:id - 댓글 삭제
  app.delete("/api/articles/:slug/comments/:id", { preHandler: app.authenticate }, async (request: any, reply: FastifyReply) => {
    const slug = request.params.slug as string;
    const commentId = parseInt(request.params.id as string, 10);

    // 먼저 slug로 article 조회
    const article = await prisma.article.findUnique({
      where: { slug },
    });

    if (!article) {
      return reply.code(404).send({ errors: { article: ["not found"] } });
    }

    // 댓글 조회
    const comment = await prisma.comment.findUnique({
      where: { id: commentId, articleId: article.id },
    });

    if (!comment) {
      return reply.code(404).send({ errors: { comment: ["not found"] } });
    }

    // 작성자 확인
    if (comment.authorId !== request.user!.id) {
      return reply.code(403).send({ errors: { comment: ["forbidden"] } });
    }

    await prisma.comment.delete({
      where: { id: commentId },
    });

    return reply.code(204).send();
  });
}
```

